{"id":"c3adf71d4c50f128","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Cone Above Node","display":"df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node — ZFC Tree9 Cone Above Node","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node — ZFC Tree9 Cone Above Node","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-cone-above-node — ZFC Tree9 Cone Above Node"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (tree carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span> (tree order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span> (base node)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (cone candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}cone\\text{-}above\\text{-}node}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S(C,T,\\preccurlyeq_T,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\n\\land\ns\\in T\n\\land\nC=\\{t\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}cone\\text{-}above\\text{-}node}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9ConeAboveNode}_S(C,T,\\preccurlyeq_T,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\n\\land\ns\\in T\n\\land\nC=\\{t\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate now has a cone output argument, rather than a three-place symbol incorrectly defined to return a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","locati